  "notes": [
    "Reflexive -ER verb. Uses reflexive pronouns (me/te/se/nos/se) in all tenses.",
    "Irregular past participle: ***roto*** (not *rompido*). Used in all compound tenses: *se ha roto, se había roto*.",
    "All other tense conjugations follow regular -ER endings.",
    "Base verb: *romper* (to break something — transitive). *Romperse* = something breaks by itself (intransitive).",
    "*Se me rompió el vaso.* (My glass broke / The glass broke on me.)",
    "*Me he roto el brazo.* (I have broken my arm.)",
    "*La cuerda se rompió de repente.* (The rope snapped suddenly.)",
    "Related: *romper* (to break something), *roto/a* (broken — adjective), *la rotura* (break, fracture)"
  ],
